\pard\nowidctlpar\qj\kerning2\f0\fs24 Please maximize the window when reading this article (WinPE producers and system customizers should look at the \cf1 configuration files in the Languages directory\cf0  and the \cf2 [parameter description]\cf0  of \cf1 this article\cf0 ).\par
\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\qc\cf3\b\fs28 WimTool is a Win32 program based on WIMGAPI and WIMLIB\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\qj\cf2\fs24 I. Basic introduction\par
\cf1\b0 1. powerful\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\fi240\qj\cf0 (1). Support WIM image processing operations such as \cf1 mounting, unloading, capturing, decompressing, exporting, importing, merging, splitting, compression type conversion, image volume optimization, and image incremental backup\cf0 , including \cf1 ESD\cf0  files of LZMS compression type;\par
(2). Support \cf1 browsing, extracting, adding, renaming, and deleting the volume information and file directories\cf0  in WIM;\par
(3). Window system that \cf1 supports online hot backup\cf0  of the current hard disk can backup your system without starting WinPE;\par
(4). Whether it is a backup system or a recovery system, WimTool can \cf1 filter and exclude file directories\cf0  for backup and recovery through the rules defined by configuration files, so as to avoid suppressing unnecessary file directories into the backed-up WIM;\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\qj\cf1 2. efficient and fast\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\fi240\qj\cf0 Pure Win32 C++ code, without Net library and VC runtime, \cf1 can run in extremely simplified system and WinPE\cf0  system;\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\qj\cf1 3. the operation is simple\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\fi240\qj\cf0 Windows graphical \cf1 window interface\cf0 , through \cf1 mouse click, pop-up menu, mouse drag and drop\cf0 , you can perform various operations on WIM files, eliminating the trouble of memorizing various command lines;\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\qj\cf1 4. Feature expansion\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\fi240\qj\cf0 WimTool s\cf1 upports setting different icon\cf0  for each WIM or ESD file, and has built-in \cf1 icon extractor and the function of converting pictures into icon\cf0 .\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\qj You can also make some software into a green single-file compressed version through [shell execution extension]. The principle is to execute a command after mounting to a specified directory. This single-file compressed version can avoid killing antivirus tools.\par
\cf1 5. rich parameters\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\fi240\qj\cf0 WimTool also has a \cf1 wealth of command line parameters\cf0 , basically covering all the functions of command line parameters in Imagex.EXE and WimLib-Imagex.EXE (see points 4 and 5, parameter introduction and parameter description).\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\qj\cf4\b\par
\cf5 II. Operating environment\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\fi240\qj\cf6\b0 Windows 7\'a1\'abWindows 11 and their corresponding PE systems are supported, and all functions can be used after installing WimMount components in the above systems; If WimMount components are not installed, most common functions (except mounting and dismounting) can be used.\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\qj\par
\cf2\b III. the document description\par
\cf6\b0 1. This tool consists of four files: the main program \cf1 WimTool.EXE\cf6 , the extended module \cf1 WimShExt.DLL\cf6 , the help file (this article, \cf1 RTF format\cf6 ) and the language resource file (\cf1 INI text format\cf6 ).\par
The help files and language resource files are located in the Languages directory.\par
2. The main program WimTool.EXE and the extension module WimShExt.DLL are divided into x64 and x86 versions. The help files and language resource files do not distinguish between x64 and x86 versions, and Simplified Chinese is the built-in version.\par
3. No matter the x64 version or x86 version, the main program WimTool.EXE and the extension module WimShExt.DLL cannot be renamed. In the Languages directory, the basic names of the help files and language resource files of each language should be the same.\par
Users can add or delete help descriptions and language resource files in different \cf1 Languages\cf6  by themselves, and the simplified Chinese system can delete the languages directory, but the package released to the outside world must ensure the integrity and standardization of the file directory.\par
\cf0\par
\cf2\b IV. Brief introduction of parameters\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\fi360\qj\cf0\b0 The WimTool command line has three types of parameters: \cf1 <function parameter>\cf0 , \cf7 <required parameter>\cf0  and [optional parameter]. Parameters in angle brackets "< >" cannot be omitted, parameters in square brackets "[]" can be omitted, and parameters between vertical lines "|" can only be selected.\par

\pard\nowidctlpar\qj\cf1 1. <functional parameters>\par
