(2). Additional file directory\par
Format: WimTool.EXE  \cf1 /Appenpath\cf6   \cf2 <image file[,image volume number|image volume name]>\cf6   <file directory within the image>  <file directory to be appended|@[\\]file directory list file>\par
Note: Only one of the image volume number or image volume name is selected, and the image file and image volume number (or image volume name) are combined as a required parameter, and they are connected by ","; If there are spaces in the file directory name, it must be surrounded by "".\par
Example: WimTool.EXE  \cf1 /Appenpath\cf6    \cf2 d:\\install.esd,4\cf6   Windows\\system32  d:\\sysbackup\\Windows\\system32\\wimgapi.dll.\par
Example: WimTool.EXE  \cf1 /Appenpath\cf6    \cf2 d:\\install.esd,4\cf6   Windows\\system32  d:\\sysbackup\\Windows\\system32\\WIM*. *\par
